{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43591","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 靖恭坊大兴善寺 圣柱联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 靖恭坊大兴善寺 圣柱联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天心惟助善，圣迹此开阳。\n载恐雷轮重，絙疑电索长。\n上冲挟螮蝀，不动束锒铛。\n饥鸟未曾啄，乖龙宁敢藏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}